      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the save_audio.py file that writes synthesized speech audio to a local file or object using a concrete external provider, I will choose Amazon Polly as the provider. Amazon Polly is a text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech. I will use the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Polly. The code will include the import of boto3 and the use of the polly client to synthesize speech and save it to a local file. </thinking>\n",
