        "text": "<thinking> To implement the select_voice.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for Text-to-Speech. I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a widely used Text-to-Speech service. The code will import the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Polly and list or select a voice for a target locale. The boto3 library and the 'polly' service identifier will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
