    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file synthesize_ssml.py that synthesizes SSML with voice and prosody controls, I need to integrate with a concrete external Text-to-Speech (TTS) provider. Amazon Polly is a suitable choice for this task as it supports SSML and offers various voice options and prosody controls. I will use the boto3 SDK to interact with Amazon Polly. The code will import boto3, create a Polly client, and define a function to synthesize SSML. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
